<title>CANADA: Man dies in Suncor oil sands mine accident.</title>
<headline>Man dies in Suncor oil sands mine accident.</headline>
<dateline>FORT MCMURRAY, Alberta 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suncor Inc said that an employee of one of its Oil Sands Group's contractors died after the light truck he was driving collided with a heavy haul vehicle in the company's oil sands mine on Friday.</p>
<p>Suncor on Monday identified the victim as Leo Walter P. Lassard, an employee of Edmonton-based TBG Contracting Ltd.</p>
<p>An investigation into the incident has been launched.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Calgary Bureau 403 531-1624</p>
</text>
